# Docker build context = the repository root (cloud/spine/container/Dockerfile, ADR 0007).
# Send only the Python packages the brain image installs; never .env, .venv, .git or data.
*
!packages/tau-core
!packages/tau-net
!packages/tau-cloud
!packages/tau-sub
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.pyc
**/tests
